OL,3,GNEWSAData centre could 'threaten
OL,4,Abumblebee and one of Britain's rarest
OL,5,Aplants'
OL,6,
OL,7,FPlans to build a new data centre could
OL,8,Fthreaten the habitat of one of
OL,9,FBritain's rarest and most endangered
OL,10,Fplants and a type of bumblebee, a
OL,11,Fwildlife trust said.
OL,13,FA Google Data Centre could come to the
OL,14,Fformer Arena Essex Raceway Local
OL,15,FWildlife Site in Thurrock, Essex, if
OL,16,Fplans are approved.
OL,18,FThe site is home to Broad-leaved
OL,19,FCudweed, and experts have claimed that
OL,20,Fthis might be the best site for the
OL,21,Frare plant in the country.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
