OL,3,GNEWSAData centre could 'threaten
OL,4,Abumblebee and one of Britain's rarest
OL,5,Aplants'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is also home to 687 invertebrates
OL,8,Fand 439 plant species, and Emily
OL,9,FButtress, from Essex Wildlife Trust,
OL,10,Fsaid if plans went ahead: "Incredibly
OL,11,Frare wildlife and habitats would be
OL,12,Fdestroyed."
